[00:01.10](1 John 4:19)
[00:02.64]The pattern of love, we learn from Jehovah
[00:09.20]Shows the way, guides our way.
[00:16.58]In all he has done, his dealings have shown us
[00:23.50]How to display his loving way.
[00:30.18]He gave us his Son, his dearest possession
[00:36.78]To cover our sin, forgiving transgression.
[00:44.64]What proof of his love—its greatest expression!
[00:51.96]His way is love, Yes, God’s way is love.
[01:00.28]When we walk his way, our love for each other
[01:17.24]Will be true, warm and true,
[01:23.84]Will move us to care for all of our brothers,
[01:30.80]Old ones and new, not just a few.
[01:37.70]True love for our God and love for our brother,
[01:44.30]We can’t have the one and not have the other.
[01:51.60]The faults of our friends, we readily cover,
[01:59.14]Proving our love, Our brotherly love.
[02:19.92]The pattern of love, the bond that unites us
[02:26.60]Lets us be family.
[02:33.62]Our Father above now warmly invites us:
[02:40.62]“Come taste and see real unity.”
[02:47.44]Come share in the love and joy that define us;
[02:54.38]God’s spirit and Word, he gives to refine us.
[03:01.40]Our brothers and friends are here to remind us,
[03:09.22]God’s way is love. Jehovah is love.
